'How can a Christian respond to suffering in their own life?|By hiding it and pretending that it does not exist|By uniting it to Christ and relieving the suffering of others|By assuming that God is angry about something|By staying away from God until it passes|1|Christians relieve suffering and unite their own to Christ (CCC 1521).',
